# Who must review what. Informational in this single-maintainer demo: required approvals are 0 (D-009).
# In a real org, turn on "Require review from Code Owners" in the governance ruleset.
# Ownership of each app lives in its YAML (owner_team); keep this file in sync when adding apps.

*                         @delta-appgov/platform

# Registry: the owning team plus security for every app
/apps/                    @delta-appgov/security
/apps/release-bot.yaml    @delta-appgov/platform @delta-appgov/security
/apps/ci-reporter.yaml    @delta-appgov/product @delta-appgov/security
/apps/docs-bot.yaml  @delta-appgov/product @delta-appgov/security
/apps/legacy-linter.yaml  @delta-appgov/product @delta-appgov/security
/inventory/               @delta-appgov/security

# The machinery: anything that runs with credentials or changes what is enforced
/.github/                 @delta-appgov/platform @delta-appgov/security
/terraform/               @delta-appgov/platform @delta-appgov/security
/scripts/                 @delta-appgov/platform @delta-appgov/security
/repositories.yaml        @delta-appgov/platform
/.github/CODEOWNERS       @delta-appgov/security
